    "צָרִיךְ עוֹד %lld יַהֲלוֹמִים. תַּמְשִׁיךְ לִלְמוֹד וְתַרְוִיחַ — אוֹ הוֹרֶה יָכוֹל לִקְנוֹת.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You need %lld more diamonds. Keep learning to earn them — or a parent can buy some."
